              <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-2">The gaps that are drainage paths, not defects.</p>
            </a>
            <a href="/why-does-exterior-caulk-keep-cracking/" class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow no-underline group">
              <p class="text-green-600 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Troubleshooting</p>
